          <p>A focused, 3 – 4 week assessment of your current cybersecurity posture against the <strong>UAE Information Assurance Standard V2</strong> — the national-level controls framework covering governance, risk management, information lifecycle, asset and supply-chain security, and technical defence-in-depth.</p>
          <p>We review your existing controls, interview key stakeholders across IT, operations, HR, and legal, observe the technical and procedural evidence, and map every UAE IA V2 control to its current implementation maturity. The output is a gap report, a prioritised remediation roadmap, and a mapping of existing ISO 27001 / NIST / CIS work to the NESA framework — so remediation doesn't duplicate effort.</p>
          <p>Led by a practitioner holding <strong>GRC Mastery</strong> and <strong>ISO 27001 Lead Auditor</strong> credentials with hands-on experience in UAE regulated-sector environments.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

