          <div class="svc-not-item"><div class="svc-not-ico"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none"><path d="M3 3l6 6M9 3l-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div><strong>Not generic checklist scoring.</strong> Evidence-based — we observe, interview, validate, rate.</div></div>
