          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Procurement-ready posture statement</strong> — a document you can use in response to client / tender questions about NESA compliance.</div></li>
          <li class="svc-deliv-item"><svg class="svc-deliv-ico" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none"><path d="M3 8l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><strong>Walkthrough session</strong> — 90-minute live review with your IT and executive teams.</div></li>
